  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At the moment if you want to edit the roles of a user, ban a user, etc, you need to find them in the Members section on the website. In order to find them you need to scroll through the list of members which appears to be organized chronologically which can quickly become a chore if trying to find a specific user to perform actions on.\n\nThe ability to sort users alphabetically or by roles and the ability to search through users in the group would go a long ways for managing a group especially for larger groups.",
